
---

## 🗂 `.gitignore`

Create a file named `.gitignore` in the project root with:

```gitignore
# Python cache / compiled files
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.pyo
*.pyd
*.so

# Virtual environments
venv/
.env/

# MacOS
.DS_Store

# Jupyter / IDE stuff
.ipynb_checkpoints/
.vscode/
.idea/

# Data and outputs (regenerate as needed)
data/lexglue_csv/
outputs/

# Logs
*.log

# Hugging Face / transformers cache
huggingface/
.cache/
